abstract: >-
  Reproducible finite-sample analysis of append-only copying in conformal
  calibration. The project contains five public regression benchmarks,
  three fixed model families, 30 random splits, six copying mechanisms,
  three coverage targets, independent score simulations, and exhaustive
  rank checks. It compares rowwise, source-ID, copy-budget, and
  effective-sample-size calibration, and quantifies coverage-width
  trade-offs under incomplete provenance.
keywords:
  - conformal prediction
  - data duplication
  - prediction intervals
  - uncertainty quantification
  - reproducibility
